                    "title": "Adjective Word Order",
                    "type": "note",
                    "content": "Adjectives in Ilonggo can come BEFORE or AFTER the noun they describe:\n\n• Before: Maayo ang balay. (The house is good.)\n• After (with 'nga' linker): Balay nga maayo (a good house)\n\nFor beginners, placing adjectives before 'ang + noun' is the safest pattern."
                }
